# Hosts the sandboxed apb instance may reach, one per line (TLS on port 443,
# matched by the server name the client sends). Add hosts for one start with
# NEARBEE_SANDBOX_ALLOW="host1 host2". Everything else has no DNS and no route.
#
# NEAR AI Cloud: the TEE models and Nearbee's direct calls.
cloud-api.near.ai
# GitHub: clones, the gh CLI and release downloads.
github.com
api.github.com
codeload.github.com
objects.githubusercontent.com
# Agent CLIs with an API key or token.
api.anthropic.com
api.openai.com
# DeepSeek Harness on the z.ai provider (ZAI_API_KEY).
api.z.ai
# Package registries: script steps that install, build and test a buyer's
# repository (bug-repro-fix) or upgrade its dependencies (vuln-deps-fix).
# npm (npm, pnpm, yarn).
registry.npmjs.org
# Yarn's default registry (Yarn classic and Berry), and the Berry releases
# corepack fetches for a repository that pins yarn in package.json.
registry.yarnpkg.com
repo.yarnpkg.com
# PyPI (uv, pip).
pypi.org
files.pythonhosted.org
# Go modules and their checksum database.
proxy.golang.org
sum.golang.org
# crates.io (cargo).
index.crates.io
static.crates.io
# The OSV vulnerability database: osv-scanner and pip-audit.
osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com
api.osv.dev
